/ref 1074 "We write $\\frac{1}{3}$ as $\\frac{5}{15}$ and $\\frac{3}{5}$ as $\\frac{9}{15},$ and then we simply subtract the numerators. This gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{5}{15}-\\frac{9}{15}=\\frac{5-9}{15}.\n$$\n\nNow, we work out $5-9$ using a number line:\n\n![](images/96/96aeff6f68fcb31f7a871381a819951ee749114228535155b2eda3b32aee8fef.png)\n\nSo, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{5-9}{15}=\\frac{-4}{15}=-\\frac{4}{15}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443846 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186443829 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443846 #edb/ref 1069 "q-119510" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443846 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443846 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate the value of $\\frac{4}{9}-\\frac{1}{2}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443846 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c7de1d22-ba4a-5f8e-8822-f3f4dfdb810b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443846 #edb/ref 1074 "We write $\\frac{4}{9}$ as $\\frac{8}{18}$ and $\\frac{1}{2}$ as $\\frac{9}{18},$ and then we simply subtract the numerators. This gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{8}{18}-\\frac{9}{18}=\\frac{8-9}{18}.\n$$\n\nNow, we work out $8-9$ using a number line:\n\n![](images/61/617ce139a9838991ce1fe0532a01da77e3e58f9e5d50184598570419b4c5a5fc.png)\n\nSo, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{8-9}{18}=\\frac{-1}{18}=-\\frac{1}{18}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443847 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186443831 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443847 #edb/ref 1069 "q-101209" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443847 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443847 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the value of $\\frac{2}{9}-\\frac{7}{9}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443847 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "cdfbed1a-906b-56f6-99dc-ee6b37df7069" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186443847 #edb/ref 1074 "Since both fractions have the same denominators, we can combine them into one fraction, which gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{9}-\\frac{7}{9}=\\frac{2-7}{9}.\n$$\n\nNow, we work out $2-7$ using a number line:\n\n![](images/bb/bb81cb03e8205a9df3a62ed47ca7b2a4c1a66ad990eaf248f8701480bb2d5bb1.png)\n\nSo, we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{2-7}{9}=\\frac{-5}{9}=-\\frac{5}{9}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
